    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668310/extras/6fbc04feabaea66a32ea81e354a86e44.poster.avif?t=1744681348\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668310/extras/6fbc04feabaea66a32ea81e354a86e44.webm?t=1744681348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668310/extras/6fbc04feabaea66a32ea81e354a86e44.mp4?t=1744681348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Explore</strong> a desert island full of oddities and misfits as Home, a cursed super intelligence bound to a soldier's corpse by an alien named Moon. This happy shabby world is inspired by Love-de-Lic classics and beloved RPGs such as Digimon World and Mario RPG.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668310/extras/1130025d576da1722f63f4a1ec8c1193.poster.avif?t=1744681348\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668310/extras/1130025d576da1722f63f4a1ec8c1193.webm?t=1744681348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668310/extras/1130025d576da1722f63f4a1ec8c1193.mp4?t=1744681348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Transform </strong>into monsters you rescue to use abilities like super strength, lightning speed, and stealth as you help Moon care for the island's inhabitants.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668310/extras/33a9baa9f33a4465c35fe3cd57b377e7.poster.avif?t=1744681348\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668310/extras/33a9baa9f33a4465c35fe3cd57b377e7.webm?t=1744681348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668310/extras/33a9baa9f33a4465c35fe3cd57b377e7.mp4?t=1744681348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Collect </strong>mysterious spirits called Whispers. As Home gains new abilities, Whispers will change and have a minigame unique to their type. The shops around the island have adopted Whispers as currency, and Moon is able to harness them as an energy source. Collect more Whispers by drinking &quot;Shabstars&quot; and observing Blood Moons!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668310/extras/ca26ce985c77a06f00ab2f938b744d7b.poster.avif?t=1744681348\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668310/extras/ca26ce985c77a06f00ab2f938b744d7b.webm?t=1744681348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668310/extras/ca26ce985c77a06f00ab2f938b744d7b.mp4?t=1744681348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Unlock </strong>a unique mod or &quot;Blessing&quot; for each save file. Blessings are optional modifications to the game rules that add extra challenge, help you complete future playthroughs faster, or change up the story. When you unlock a save file's Blessing, it will be available to use in all future playthroughs.",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668310/extras/6fbc04feabaea66a32ea81e354a86e44.poster.avif?t=1744681348\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668310/extras/6fbc04feabaea66a32ea81e354a86e44.webm?t=1744681348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668310/extras/6fbc04feabaea66a32ea81e354a86e44.mp4?t=1744681348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Explore</strong> a desert island full of oddities and misfits as Home, a cursed super intelligence bound to a soldier's corpse by an alien named Moon. This happy shabby world is inspired by Love-de-Lic classics and beloved RPGs such as Digimon World and Mario RPG.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668310/extras/1130025d576da1722f63f4a1ec8c1193.poster.avif?t=1744681348\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668310/extras/1130025d576da1722f63f4a1ec8c1193.webm?t=1744681348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668310/extras/1130025d576da1722f63f4a1ec8c1193.mp4?t=1744681348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Transform </strong>into monsters you rescue to use abilities like super strength, lightning speed, and stealth as you help Moon care for the island's inhabitants.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668310/extras/33a9baa9f33a4465c35fe3cd57b377e7.poster.avif?t=1744681348\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668310/extras/33a9baa9f33a4465c35fe3cd57b377e7.webm?t=1744681348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668310/extras/33a9baa9f33a4465c35fe3cd57b377e7.mp4?t=1744681348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Collect </strong>mysterious spirits called Whispers. As Home gains new abilities, Whispers will change and have a minigame unique to their type. The shops around the island have adopted Whispers as currency, and Moon is able to harness them as an energy source. Collect more Whispers by drinking &quot;Shabstars&quot; and observing Blood Moons!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668310/extras/ca26ce985c77a06f00ab2f938b744d7b.poster.avif?t=1744681348\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668310/extras/ca26ce985c77a06f00ab2f938b744d7b.webm?t=1744681348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668310/extras/ca26ce985c77a06f00ab2f938b744d7b.mp4?t=1744681348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Unlock </strong>a unique mod or &quot;Blessing&quot; for each save file. Blessings are optional modifications to the game rules that add extra challenge, help you complete future playthroughs faster, or change up the story. When you unlock a save file's Blessing, it will be available to use in all future playthroughs.",
    "short_description": "Explore a desert island full of oddities, transform into monsters you've rescued, collect mysterious spirits, and unlock mods that change up future playthroughs.",
    "supported_languages": "English, Portuguese - Brazil",
    "reviews": "\u201cI\u2019m legitimately surprised by how 24 Killers manages to be so closely related to its influences yet still provide a unique experience. A studio\u2019s philosophy is an intangible thing to try and mimic, but Happy Shabby Games seems to have taken 24 Killers protracted development period and nailed it.\u201d<br>8 \u2013 Destructoid<br><br>\u201c24 Killers carves out its own identity through brisk, witty dialogue and a wide variety of bespoke mechanics. These elements combine to form an incredibly engrossing and endearing experience.\u201d<br>8.5 \u2013 RPGFan<br>",
